OL,3,GNEWSAA number of deaths expected after
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is believed that a number of people
OL,7,Fmay have died following a house fire in
OL,8,FWaterford city in the Republic of
OL,9,FIreland.
OL,11,FIt happened at a housing estate in the
OL,12,FBirchwood area, just off the Killure
OL,13,FRoad.
OL,15,FThe emergency services, including
OL,16,Ffirefighters and gardai (Irish police),
OL,17,Fremain at the scene.
OL,19,FStaff from Gas Networks Ireland also
OL,20,Fattended, according to Irish
OL,21,Fbroadcaster RTE.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
